WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.230
<b>Lemon</b>

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:35.990
Hey!

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:38.200
Oh, the owner of South Wind again?

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.490
On another scouting mission?

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.340
Not today.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.410
Then what?

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.390
Don't tell me you've made another weird

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:46.510
fake squid and come to challenge us.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.320
How dare you?!

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.630
Just who do you think I am?

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.460
I think you're a regular old weird guy.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:53.820
Well, whatever.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.660
Are you all free later?

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.010
What the squid do you mean?

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.470
Do you have business with us?

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.730
How about you all come over to our place?

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:07.520
<b>Care To Squidertain Our Guests?!</b>

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.260
Here it is.

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.300
Nice place!

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.070
Not what I was expecting at all from a-

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.790
I feel like I just saw something 
I wasn't supposed to see.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.080
This is bad. If she sees this...

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.100
My squidly head's come off!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.080
My squidly head's come off!

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.400
What's wrong?

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.380
Hey, wai-

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:35.920
What is that?

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.570
It's pretty creepy.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:39.510
Is that it?

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.620
Oh, I remember.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:46.560
It's the hat she identifies the most with.

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.690
I thought you only had one of these!

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.630
You think you can get there in one shot?

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.880
I've got a whole bunch of test versions 
in the shed out back!

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:56.530
Wanna see?

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.560
I'll pass.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.780
Aizawa?

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.910
What are you doing here?

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.990
What, you didn't even tell her?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.830
Because I just thought of it!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.050
H-here you go.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.260
Well then.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:19.990
Say something.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.500
This guy's as volatile as a blowfish.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.210
We've got to watch our step!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.510
Oh, that reminds me, Ayumi.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:30.840
Ayumi is such a cute name.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.640
Oh...

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.520
Thank you.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:37.200
How introverted can you be?

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:38.730
Hey.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.330
You have nothing to say to me?

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.400
Not really.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.440
Then fine!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.700
Huh? Did I make him mad?

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.530
Then I'll ask you:

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.580
What's your name?

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.780
Huh?

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.340
You don't even know my name?

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:54.710
It's Eiko! Eiko!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.190
I'm Eiko Aizawa.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:57.320
And she's...

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:57.950
Stop there!

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.710
I know Squid Girl.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.340
I guess you would obviously know that.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.940
Talk about awkward.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.680
I think it's just about time for us to-

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.650
What's your beef?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.940
If you don't like something, just say it!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.770
I don't squidding like humans!

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:19.320
I don't care.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.180
What kind of conversation is this?

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:26.140
You better not move a muscle!

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:27.410
What?!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.150
I think I might have upset him.

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.920
No, I think he's very happy.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.040
What part of him, exactly?

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.550
I'd say all of him.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.760
What the hell?!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.800
What's this racket?

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.330
I'm sorry.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:48.600
Were we being too loud?

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.470
No, you're fine.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:53.560
He was holding a knife.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.140
He was.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.900
Is that all you've got to say?!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.080
I thought she was the normal one,

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.820
but maybe I was wrong.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.280
I'm sorry, but I really 
do think we should go.

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.410
I'll just have to...

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.700
Please get me, sis!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.700
Eiko, that face is really squidsturbing.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.220
Shut up!

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.730
What now?!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:24.050
I was just... umm... 
wondering if I could use the toilet.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:24.760
No.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.260
What?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.010
Hold it.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.640
I'll show you the way soon.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.310
You can just tell me and 
I'll find it myself.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.370
I said, "No"!

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:37.600
I hope this old guy doesn't plan on 
keeping us locked in here forever.

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:38.730
It's this way.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:40.810
I'm going too.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.320
It's over there!

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:46.860
I'm pretty sure that's the shed where 
he said he keeps the heads.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:50.730
If you're not going, I will.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.700
Then go ahead.

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.330
What's this?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.530
First, the sensors automatically 
raise the toilet lid.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.480
When you sit down, music starts to play 
to effectively muffle any noise.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.550
Pressing on the right cheek 
activates the shower function.

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:13.010
Cheek?

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.960
Pressing the left cheek 
activates the wipe function.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:18.890
And then, pushing the nose...

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:19.770
The nose?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.780
Pushing the nose flushes the toilet.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.130
So, what do you think of 
the toilet hospitality?

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.860
I've only got a bad feeling about it.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:33.590
I feel squidding used.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:41.080
It's even worse than I thought!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.970
Was that comfortable, or what?

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.130
How could it be-

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.440
Wait a minute...

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.180
Maybe this is his way of showing he cares?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.000
Sorry it took so long.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.140
These dishes are my own creation, so dig in!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.050
Wow, these look really good!

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:57.820
Thank you!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.900
There's more if you want seconds.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.890
This is delicious!

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.060
Isn't it?

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:10.280
I guess she knew he was trying to 
be hospitable from the very start.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:13.190
There's a flavor in here I just can't place.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.660
May I ask how you made it?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.040
Like I'd tell you.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:21.540
O-of course you wouldn't.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.660
We are competitors, after all.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.130
Thank you.

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.900
It's getting late, so we should be...

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:29.800
Wait.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.310
Who said you could go home?

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.470
How long do we have to keep 
following his crazy rules?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.280
You haven't had your dessert yet.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:40.030
Thank you.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:43.850
What did you just say?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:45.980
I said thank you!

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:47.940
What are you talking about?

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.740
My daughter.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.250
Ever since she's been 
going over to your place,

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.000
Ayumi's been talking more.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.240
She's been able to express 
her feelings more, too.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:03.720
It looks like she's still afraid 
of men, but she's made a big step.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.360
I really am grateful to you all.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:09.770
I hope you'll keep being 
a good influence on her.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.130
Of course!

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.890
Yes, we'll do our best!

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.850
Just leave it to me!

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:20.310
Yes.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.400
It's already nine o'clock.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.900
Can you please go home right now?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.210
What's wrong?

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.240
I gave you my hospitality.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.500
I said thank you.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.730
Why are you so blunt?

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:37.620
Can't you be a little more subtle about it?

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:40.830
I am a man who detests 
pointless affectations!

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.860
Pointless affectations, huh?

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.540
Hey, Squid Girl.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.110
Dinner's ready.

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:06.190
Coming...

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.360
Hey, hurry up!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.780
What's the hold up?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.400
Is she playing video games again?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.220
Eiko, hold on.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:20.330
Squid Girl, we're having fried shrimp tonight!

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.260
I'm coming right now!

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:24.260
See?

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.580
You're good.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:28.390
Shrimp... shrimp!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:34.650
What was that?

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:35.800
Squid Girl?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.290
That was a really loud noise. Are you okay?

00:09:40.920 --> 00:09:43.420
Where am I?

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:44.850
Who am I?

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.330
Huh?

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.520
Don't tell me she's got... amnesia?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:54.530
<b>Ink That Amnesia?!</b>

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:58.360
I have no idea what the squid is going on.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.860
It is amnesia!

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.490
But she hasn't forgotten 
 that speech pattern of hers.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.110
You really don't remember anything?

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:07.980
Who the squid are you?

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.370
You wanna fight?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.250
Shrimp!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:29.580
Someone who gives me shrimp 
can't be that bad.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.300
Is that really how you judge people?

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.730
Maybe if you eat more shrimp, 
you'll remember stuff!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.200
You're a good person.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.010
How come I'm "can't be that bad" and

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:44.150
Takeru's automatically a good person?!

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:48.120
Will you consider me your friend, too, 
if I give you shrimp?

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.900
I could never accept anything 
like that from you.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.470
Please squidly forgive me!

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:57.220
I guess she judges us 
based on her instincts.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.220
Isn't there anything you remember?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.330
I don't know...

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:06.180
I can't imagine you've 
forgotten your own mission.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.470
Nope!

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:09.480
Infiltrating the surface world!

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.390
Almost!

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.950
But you're being kind of defensive.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.170
Was my mission something else?

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.660
Uh... no...

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.840
Maybe I should keep her invasion plans

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:22.280
from her while she doesn't remember anything.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.120
<b>Lemon</b>

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.660
You're saying she's got...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.740
amnesia?

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:31.980
You're actually an alien.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.670
You're my girlfriend.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:36.090
Looks like we've got the same idea!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.690
An alien?

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.800
Your girlfriend?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.450
It happened on a summer day last year.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.680
I was out for a walk at night.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.900
I saw the light grow before my very eyes.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:16.190
A UFO made an emergency landing 
and it was carrying you!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:25.180
Then, the very first person you 
met on this planet was me!

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:34.420
We're not the same species,
 but it was love at first sight.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:41.280
Both our souls were lonely, 
so our meeting was destiny.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.530
Stop rewriting her memories!

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:46.120
Damn.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.390
That's not what happened?

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.060
You're actually Eiko's younger sister.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.390
Not you, too!

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:55.400
But isn't that right?

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.760
Squid Girl is your little sister

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:58.640
(and equivalent)

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.630
isn't that right?

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:08.380
So which one of them is telling the truth?

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.390
I don't want to be an alien.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:15.780
And my inkstincts are rejecting 
being this one's girlfriend.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.810
Which leaves...

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.440
Sis...

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.560
No, please... not that... p-please don't...

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:30.920
But Takeru calls you "sis" too...

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.040
Will you call me sis too?

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:33.990
Can you please clam up?!

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:39.110
What the squid am I?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:42.250
I'm starting to feel all this doubt.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.750
I bet.

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:47.980
We don't know how much of 
your memory will return,

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.300
but here's what I know about you:

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:52.640
You came from the sea.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.470
Yeah.

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.640
You don't like sharks.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.480
Yeah.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.100
Shrimp is your favorite food.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:57.940
Yeah.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:00.110
And if you take that hat 
off your head, you'll die.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:00.940
Yeah.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:13.170
You really expect me to believe 
that I came from the sea?

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:13.810
What?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.460
You don't believe that part?

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:18.560
Here I am on land, breathing with lungs,

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.210
so how am I supposed to breathe underwater?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.900
Yeah, we've been wondering about that, too.

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.400
And I'll "die" if my hat is taken off?

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:29.400
Why am I even wearing a 
hat in the first place?

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:32.470
It won't come off.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.930
Hey, don't force it!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.440
Why you...!

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.260
I remember everything.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.700
Squid Girlie...

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:01.130
It's like all this stuff flashed before 
my eyes and now I remember it all!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.880
So you really would die 
if you took that off.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.960
I remember all your names, too!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.130
Takeru.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.300
Chizuru.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:10.750
Cindy.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.140
Eiko.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:18.260
I remember all that's transpired up to now.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.100
Being chased by the shark.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.060
Being threatened by Chizuru.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.480
Being brainwashed by Cindy.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.210
Fighting with Eiko.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.600
What are you talking about?

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.040
That's not everything!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.450
Don't you remember anything fun?

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.800
Anything fun?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.880
You know, like our date?

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:39.620
Who the squid are you?

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.960
Why?!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.040
Let's get shaved ice on the way home!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.360
Sounds good!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:53.490
How about we get them at 
Senior Squid Girl's place?

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:54.510
Great idea!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.130
I wonder if she's there?

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.310
Kiyomi!

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.180
I'll go belly-up waiting much longer.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.920
Did you wait all this time 
for our club to be over?

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:04.830
Yeah!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.540
Eiko actually gave me the day off.

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.150
You could've just met us on the field.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.950
But you know how crazy it gets 
when I show up there.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:17.660
Yeah, the other clubs would 
probably try to scout you.

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.000
It's hard to be popular!

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:25.000
<b>You Porpoise Joining The Club?!</b>

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.960
There sure are all sorts of clubs.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:31.900
Yeah.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:35.900
There's clubs for baseball, 
track and field, soccer, tennis...

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:37.040
Then we've got...

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.480
the brass band, and the light music club...

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:41.810
There's the handicrafts 
club, and the art club.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:44.230
We've got a lot of clubs at our school.

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:49.020
Then I'm going to join the invasion club!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.940
The invasion club?

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.110
I don't think we have one of those.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.910
Then I just need to make one!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.900
That sounds like a lot of fun!

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:58.670
We're going to join, too!

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:00.700
The five of us can make the invasion club.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:01.810
Sounds good.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.870
But what can we do about a place to meet?

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.250
Invasion Club

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:11.210
From this day on, this is where
the invasion club will meet!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:15.180
Invasion club

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.180
That's quite a step down from "Invasion Base."

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:18.800
Squiddie, I probably should've 
asked this earlier but...

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.100
What is it?

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.850
What do you do in an invasion club?

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:29.580
What do humans do in a club, anyway?

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.120
You didn't think about it at all?

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.270
Normally it's just what the club name says.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:35.240
The soccer club plays soccer.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.390
The kendo club practices kendo.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.950
So that means...

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.700
This is an invasion club, so...

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:44.150
We've got to invade something.

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:48.460
Then we should invade the surface world!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.710
You're a little short on members.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.420
So what have you invaded so far?

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.490
Well... I invaded... this house by the sea.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.430
And Eiko's house.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.720
How was that an invasion?!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.680
So that's how it works?

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.630
What are you doing?

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.070
I'm making an invasion map for our club.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:15.260
Like Senior Squid Girl said, this 
place and Eiko's house have

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.990
already been invaded.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.800
And I think we can consider 
our school invaded as well.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:23.660
If you connect the three, the interior area can

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.000
be considered our club's territory.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.210
How about we count any places

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.830
where we've all gone together 
as successfully invaded?

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.260
Good idea!

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.680
Sounds like a plan.

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:35.960
Let's do it!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:39.020
Looks like there's a lot of 
places for us to invade.

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:40.010
This is going to be fun.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.970
Then let's start invading right away!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:44.860
Yeah!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.890
Looks like they've started something again.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:51.090
Invade, invade, invade, 
 invade, invade, invade!

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:52.030
Squid Girl!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.020
Karaoke

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:54.020
Invasion successful!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.720
I did it!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.280
Wow! Great!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.780
Bowling Alley

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.780
Invasion successful!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:11.830
Pool

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.830
Invasion successful...

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.250
Cheers!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.630
You're going to eat all that?

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.210
Family
Restaurant

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.210
Invasion successful!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:19.220
Cute!

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.330
That looks so good on you!

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.470
Do you really think so?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.250
Try this on next.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.920
And this should look good too!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.520
Department Store

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:30.520
Invasion successful...
